OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBands of
OL,6,Frain in the north and west move
OL,7,Fsoutheastwards into central areas.
OL,8,FClear intervals follow with showers in
OL,9,Fthe north and northwest. Southern and
OL,10,Feastern England remains mainly dry,
OL,11,Fbut very mild and muggy for some.
