OL,13,CTuesday:FShowery outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fmove south across England and Wales.
OL,15,FSunshine and showers in the north.
OL,16,FHumid in the south at first, but
OL,17,Fturning fresher for everyone by the
OL,18,Fevening.
